/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9cd8b7bf4a1e2521END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6d88c55950325705END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WYR_Windmill_AbsoluteLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_Windmill_AbsoluteLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_Windmill_AbsoluteLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">08295700-6dee-479e-96f6-690a7db1c72c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:08295700-6dee-479e-96f6-690a7db1c72c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:08295700-6dee-479e-96f6-690a7db1c72c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Basement of the <a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Windmill\" title=\"Abandoned Windmill\">Abandoned Windmill</a>, on the body of the newborn <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(windmill)\" title=\"Mind flayer (windmill)\">Mind Flayer</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>True Soul Alyan, \n</p><p>Your time has come - the Absolute calls to all faithful, and you have been faithful indeed. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Leave your barracks, leave your armour, leave all insignia of rank behind - you are part of the Flaming Fist no longer.\n</p><p>You have been a loyal True Soul, but soon you will be so much more. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>You will be <b>one of us.</b>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202510\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23563/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5762/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931396/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.488      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.488      1 -total\n 50.37%   20.393      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.00%   18.219     15 Template:Trim\n 24.82%   10.051      2 Template:Uid\n 15.84%    6.412      1 Template:Main_only\n 15.00%    6.073      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.34%    4.590      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.18%    4.526      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.56%    4.277      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12862-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202510 and revision id 235314. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}